  "title": "Evotec Receives Grants to Advance Tuberculosis Treatment",
  "summary": "Evotec SE today announced that it has received two grants from the Gates Foundation for drug discovery and translation in tuberculosis (TB), following four earlier TB grants from the foundation, amounting to $4.9 million over 25 months and $5 million over 24 months. The new funding underscores Evotec’s commitment to translating innovative science into impactful therapies addressing high-priority public health threats. Read full PR here.",
